<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφων-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mention by name, tell of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφωνεῖν..ἱερὰν θήκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1762
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.14
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.Parv.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>add a title,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.337
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>say with respect to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ ἐπιφώνημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Luc.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.Cit.
					3
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>apply</i> a phrase <i>to,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.178e
			</span></i>: freq. of quoted sayings, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸ τραγικόν κτλ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.127
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>call out, proclaim, exclaim,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὡς " εὖ ἡμῖν βεβίωται "</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.Vat.</u>
					47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεφώνουν λέγοντες κτλ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					23.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				77.33
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὶ καλῶς
				λέγειν</span> Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				196
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1251.17
			</span></i>,al., <i>lG</i><i><span class="en">
				14.830
			</span></i> (Puteoli, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ
				παρὰ δεῖπνον ἀκράτῳ προσδιδομένῳ τὸν Ἀγαθὸν
				ἐπιφωνοῦσι Δαίμονα</span> Philonid.
				Med.
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.675b
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τοῖς γαμοῦσιν -φωνούμενον "
				ταλασίῳ </span>" <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>respond,</i> in ritual, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				1.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>subjoin, add as a finishing touch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				107
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				4.9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
